Crairuv
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
UQO 4 FACE_LAST
UQO 0 FACE_LAST
UQO 6 FACE_LAST
UQO 0 FACE_LAST
UQO 1 FACE_ALL

COLUMN 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
COLUMN 8 FACE_LAST

BAED 6 FACE_HALF
BAED 7 FACE_HALF
BAED 4 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE UQO UQO
AND
    DEST Size > 0
    OR
        SRC Rank 1
        DEST Rank K
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
DEST Rank 1
MOVE_STACK COLUMN UQO
DEST Rank K
MOVE_STACK {COLUMN, UQO, BAED} BAED
SRC Rank K
$win
PILE ALL UQO Empty
